---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Setiawan Joddy"
  description="The story behind Setiawan Joddy's work across AI research, product, and education."
>
  <section class="page-shell page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">About / Profile</p>
    <h1>The throughline is translation.</h1>
    <p class="intro-copy">
      Between research and products. Between technical teams and human needs. Between ideas and the
      people who can move them forward.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="page-shell narrative-grid">
    <p class="index">The short version</p>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        I’m an Assistant Professor at BINUS University, an applied AI researcher, and a product
        practitioner. My work has moved through media, agritech, iOS development, academic
        partnerships, and machine learning research.
      </p>
      <p>
        Those paths look different on paper, but they ask the same question: how do we turn a
        complicated idea into something another person can understand, trust, and use?
      </p>
      <p>
        I’m especially interested in Product Manager and AI Product Manager roles where research
        literacy, technical judgment, and clear product direction need to coexist.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-shell section-grid education-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="index">01 / Foundation</p>
      <h2>Education</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="credential-list">
      <article>
        <p>BINUS University</p>
        <h3>Master of Computer Science</h3>
        <p>GPA 3.91 · Summa Cum Laude</p>
        <small>Research: imbalanced N-linked glycosylation data using SMOTE-ENN and 1D CNN</small>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p>BINUS University</p>
        <h3>Bachelor of Information Systems</h3>
        <small>Research: tuberculosis patient patterns using K-means clustering</small>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p>Apple Developer Academy @BINUS</p>
        <h3>Product and iOS development</h3>
        <small>Cross-functional product practice through challenge-based learning</small>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-shell principles">
    <p class="index">02 / How I work</p>
    <h2>Evidence before certainty. Clarity before complexity. People before features.</h2>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
